Modified/generated ChatSymbolRanges.h includes sorted, merged ranges for
Emoji_Presentation, Emoji_Modifier, non-ASCII/non-modifier Emoji joiner bases,
and the emoji tag subset of Emoji_Component.
It does not copy emoji glyphs or images. Original source is retained unchanged.

The small Chinese display-label policy is part of Ekko Studio firmware.
It preserves ordinary mathematical/code/music symbols and never alters the
server database or expands message text buffers.
